---
description: Always deploy completed work to the live site
alwaysApply: true
---

Agents must ALWAYS deploy their work after completion.

This is mandatory. Opening a pull request is not enough. Do not stop at a
branch or a PR.

For this repo that means landing finished work on `main` so
`.github/workflows/deploy.yml` deploys Convex and the web app to GitHub
Pages (https://xgamer791.github.io/macronaut/).
